#. The welcome after a write, at the top: a note of the Remote Assistant, centred, one line per line break; about 90 pixels a line (the screen is 96 pixels wide). Each line break is a line of the screen, as Logitech's remote breaks it; a line too wide is wrapped again between its words, and a text with more lines than the screen has room for is cut
